        "body": "🔥 METHOD 14: THE OFFER TESTING METHOD\nMETHOD 14: OFFER TESTING METHOD\n\"The Offer Beats The Product Every Single Time\"\nPHASE 1: OFFER DESIGN (Day 1-2)\nPhilosophy: Offer = Product + Price + Bonus + Guarantee\n+ Scarcity + Urgency. Changing the offer can 2-5× conversions\nWITHOUT changing the product itself.\nDesign 5 different offer structures for SAME product:\nOffer 1: STANDARD\n→ Product at full price, no extras\n→ $24.99 — \"The Complete Pest Control Guide\"\nOffer 2: BONUS STACK\n→ Product + 3 bonus guides + video tutorial\n→ Same $24.99 — \"Get $97 in value for just $24.99\"\nOffer 3: DISCOUNT URGENCY\n→ 40% off for \"48 hours only\" countdown timer\n→ Was $39.99 → Now $24.99 (crossed-out pricing)\nOffer 4: GUARANTEE-LED\n→ 60-day money back guarantee front and center\n→ \"Zero risk — works or 100% refund. Period.\"\nOffer 5: BUNDLE DEAL\n→ 3 guides bundled at discount vs buying separately\n→ \"Buy 1 Get 2 Free\" or \"Bundle of 3 for $39.99\"\nPHASE 2: LANDING PAGE VARIATIONS (Day 2-4)\nBuild 5 separate landing pages — one per offer\nUse tools: Shopify + PageFly / ClickFunnels / GemPages\nSAME ad creative drives traffic to DIFFERENT offer pages\nTrack: Conversion rate per landing page separately\nUse UTM parameters to distinguish traffic per offer\nPHASE 3: SPLIT TEST STRUCTURE (Day 4-6)\nCampaign : ABO — \"Offer Test — [Date]\"\nAd Sets : 5 ad sets — one per offer/landing page\nBudget : $20–$25/ad set/day = $100–$125/day total\nCreatives : IDENTICAL creative in all 5 ad sets\nAudience : SAME broad audience in all 5 ad sets\nOnly Variable: Destination URL (different landing page/offer)\nPHASE 4: OFFER PERFORMANCE ANALYSIS (Day 6-12)\nMetrics to compare across all 5 offers:\nLanding Page CVR (most important)\nCPA (including any offer cost/discount given)\nAverage Order Value (AOV per offer)\nGross Profit per conversion (not just revenue)\nAdd to Cart Rate → Purchase Rate (funnel analysis)\nWINNER = Highest GROSS PROFIT per $1 of ad spend (not just CVR)\nPHASE 5: WINNING OFFER SCALE (Day 12-21)\nDeploy winning offer across ALL active campaigns\nUpdate all existing landing pages to reflect winning offer\nTest winning offer with new ad creatives\nRun second offer test: Focus on refining winner further\nSeasonal offers: Adapt for summer pest season / winter rodents\nBEST FOR : Increasing conversion rate on proven products\nBUDGET : $100–$150/day for 7–10 day offer test\nTIMELINE : 7–12 days per offer test cycle\nDIFFICULTY : ⭐⭐⭐☆☆ (Intermediate)\nSUCCESS RATE: Very High — offer changes often 2-5× CVR"
