        "meta": {},
        "body": "🔥 METHOD 1: VERTICAL BUDGET SCALING (THE SAFE LADDER)\nMETHOD 1: VERTICAL BUDGET SCALING\n\"The Safest Way to Grow Without Breaking Winners\"\nPHASE 1: PRE-SCALE QUALIFICATION (Before Touching Budget)\nOnly scale vertically when ALL conditions are met:\n✅ ROAS > 2.5× for minimum 3 consecutive days\n✅ CPA within 20% of your target for 3+ days\n✅ Ad set has spent at least 2× your target CPA\n✅ Campaign is OUT of Learning Phase\n✅ Frequency below 2.5 (audience not exhausted)\n✅ CTR still above 1.5% (creative still fresh)\n✅ Stock/fulfillment can handle increased order volume\nIf ANY condition fails → Fix that issue first, don't scale\nPHASE 2: THE SCALING LADDER SYSTEM (Day 1 Onward)\nThe Golden Rule: NEVER increase more than 20% every 48–72hrs\nExample Starting Budget: $50/day\nDay 1 : $50/day (baseline — confirmed winner)\nDay 3 : $60/day (+20% — first increase)\nDay 5 : $72/day (+20%)\nDay 7 : $86/day (+20%)\nDay 9 : $103/day (+20%)\nDay 11 : $124/day (+20%)\nDay 13 : $149/day (+20%)\nDay 15 : $179/day (+20%)\nDay 17 : $215/day (+20%)\nDay 21 : $258/day (+20%)\nDay 25 : $310/day (+20%)\nDay 30 : $372/day (+20%)\n$50/day → $372/day in 30 days = 644% budget increase\nAt 3× ROAS: $372/day spend → $1,116/day revenue\nPHASE 3: INCREASE TIMING RULES (Critical)\n✅ Make increases at the SAME time each day (e.g., 8:00 AM)\n✅ Best time to increase: Early morning before spend begins\n✅ Wait MINIMUM 48 hours between each increase\n✅ After each increase: monitor for 24hrs before next change\n❌ NEVER increase on Mondays (algorithm resets — wait til Tue)\n❌ NEVER increase more than 30% in a single edit\n❌ NEVER increase if previous day's ROAS dropped below target\nPHASE 4: PERFORMANCE CHECKPOINTS (After Each Increase)\nAfter every budget increase, check these signals:\nSignal Good Sign Warning Sign\nCPA Stable or lower Rising >20%\nROAS Stable or higher Dropping >0.5×\nCTR Stable Dropping >0.5%\nCPM Slight increase Jumping >30%\nFrequency Below 3.0 Above 3.5\nSpend Pacing On target daily Under/over pacing\nPHASE 5: EMERGENCY ROLLBACK PROTOCOL\nIf performance collapses after increase:\nStep 1: Immediately reduce budget back to previous level\nStep 2: Wait 48 hours for algorithm to restabilize\nStep 3: If still poor → reduce to 50% of original budget\nStep 4: If recovers → restart scaling ladder from new base\nStep 5: If does not recover → duplicate into new campaign\nBEST FOR : ABO campaigns with proven winners\nBUDGET RANGE : Any — works from $20/day to $2,000/day\nRISK LEVEL : 🟢 LOW — gradual and controlled\nSPEED : Slow but sustainable v\nDIFFICULTY : ⭐⭐☆☆☆ (Beginner)\nIDEAL PHASE : Month 1–6 of scaling journey"
