        "body": "🔥 METHOD 3: CBO CONSOLIDATION SCALING\nMETHOD 3: CBO CONSOLIDATION SCALING\n\"Merge Your Winners Into One Powerful Campaign\"\nPHASE 1: WHEN TO USE CBO CONSOLIDATION (Prerequisites)\n✅ You have 3–6 proven winning ABO ad sets\n✅ Each ABO winner has 5+ purchases independently\n✅ Pixel has 100+ purchase events total\n✅ You want to increase total spend without managing many ABOs\n✅ You trust Facebook's AI to allocate budget intelligently\n⚠️ Do NOT close original ABOs until CBO is stable (14 days)\nPHASE 2: CBO CONSOLIDATION SETUP (Day 1)\nStep 1: Identify top 4–6 winning ad sets from your ABOs\nStep 2: Create a NEW CBO campaign\nStep 3: Migrate WINNING ad sets into the CBO\nStep 4: Set CBO budget = sum of all winning ABO budgets\nExample Migration:\nABO Ad Set 1 (Broad) : $40/day → moved to CBO\nABO Ad Set 2 (Interest A): $40/day → moved to CBO\nABO Ad Set 3 (LLA 1%) : $40/day → moved to CBO\nABO Ad Set 4 (Interest B): $40/day → moved to CBO\nCBO Campaign Budget: $160/day (combined)\nWith Scale-Up Bonus: $200/day (+25% at launch)\nPHASE 3: CBO MANAGEMENT RULES (Day 1-14)\n✅ Set Minimum Daily Spend per ad set (10–15% of CBO budget)\n→ Prevents CBO from ignoring certain ad sets entirely\n✅ Set Maximum Daily Spend per ad set (40% of CBO budget)\n→ Prevents over-concentration in one ad set\n✅ DO NOT touch for first 7 days — let CBO learn\n✅ Keep original ABOs running at reduced budget as backup\n❌ Do NOT add new untested ad sets into active CBO\n❌ Do NOT edit ad sets inside CBO (resets learning)\nPHASE 4: CBO SCALING (Day 14-30)\nAfter stable performance (14 days):\nIncrease CBO budget: +20% every 48–72 hours\nAdd new winning ad sets from ongoing ABO testing\nCBO Scaling Path:\nDay 14 : $200/day (stable CBO established)\nDay 17 : $240/day (+20%)\nDay 20 : $288/day (+20%)\nDay 23 : $346/day (+20%)\nDay 26 : $415/day (+20%)\nDay 30 : $498/day (+20%)\nPHASE 5: ADVANCED CBO PORTFOLIO (Day 30+)\nRun 2–3 separate CBO campaigns simultaneously:\nCBO 1: Prospecting audiences (broad + interests)\nCBO 2: Lookalike audiences (LLA 1–5%)\nCBO 3: Retargeting audiences (warm traffic only)\nEach CBO operates independently with its own budget\nTotal portfolio managed via MER (blended ROAS metric)\nBEST FOR : Intermediate-advanced sellers with pixel data\nBUDGET RANGE : $150–$2,000/day per CBO\nRISK LEVEL : 🟡 MODERATE\nSPEED : Fast — 3-5× scale within 30 days\nDIFFICULTY : ⭐⭐⭐☆☆ (Intermediate)\nIDEAL PHASE : Month 2–6 of scaling journey"
