        "tagline": "Facebook's AI Scales For You Automatically",
        "meta": {},
        "body": "🔥 METHOD 4: ADVANTAGE+ SHOPPING CAMPAIGN (ASC) SCALING\nMETHOD 4: ASC SCALING METHOD\n\"Facebook's AI Scales For You Automatically\"\nPHASE 1: ASC SCALING PHILOSOPHY (Read First)\nASC handles targeting + placement + bidding automatically\nYour ONLY scaling lever = Budget + Creative Quality\nPhilosophy: Feed the machine better creatives + more budget\nASC self-optimizes — your job is creative supply + budget\nBest combined with: ABO testing running simultaneously\nPHASE 2: ASC SCALING STRUCTURE (Day 1-7)\nStart with single ASC at proven budget\nScale using \"ASC Stack\" method:\nASC Campaign 1: $200/day\n→ 12 creatives loaded (mix of formats)\n→ Existing customer cap: 15%\n→ USA only\n→ Running 14+ days (stable)\nASC Campaign 2: $200/day (NEW — duplicate for scale)\n→ Same creatives + 3 new creatives added\n→ Existing customer cap: 10%\n→ USA only (separate auction from Campaign 1)\nASC Campaign 3: $150/day (International)\n→ UK + CA + AU targeting\n→ Same creative set as Campaign 1\n→ Separate geography = no auction overlap\nTotal: $550/day across 3 ASC campaigns\nPHASE 3: CREATIVE SCALING WITHIN ASC (Ongoing)\nCreative management is YOUR primary scaling tool in ASC:\nWeek 1 : Launch with 10–12 diverse creatives\nWeek 2 : Remove bottom 3 → Add 3 new creatives\nWeek 3 : Identify top 2 performers → make variations\nWeek 4 : Full creative refresh (keep 4 winners + 8 new)\nMonthly: Minimum 12–15 NEW creatives per month\nCreative Mix for ASC Scaling:\n• 40% UGC videos (highest performer in most accounts)\n• 25% Product demo / explainer videos\n• 20% Static images (lifestyle + white background)\n• 15% Carousel / Collection format\nPHASE 4: ASC BUDGET SCALING PROTOCOL (Day 7-30)\nASC Budget Scaling Rules (DIFFERENT from ABO rules):\n✅ Can increase ASC budget by up to 30% every 48 hours\n✅ ASC is more resilient to budget changes than ABO\n✅ If ROAS stable for 3 days → increase 25-30%\n✅ If ROAS drops after increase → reduce 15% and hold\n❌ Do NOT delete and recreate ASC campaigns (loses data)\n❌ Do NOT change the \"existing customer cap\" during scale\nPHASE 5: ASC + ABO HYBRID SYSTEM (Day 14+)\nRun simultaneously:\n• ASC (60% of total budget): Automated scaling engine\n• ABO (30% of total budget): Manual testing + control\n• Retargeting ABO (10% of budget): Warm audience recovery\nWinners from ABO testing → Feed into ASC as new creatives\nASC provides stability; ABO provides intelligence\nBEST FOR : E-commerce stores with product catalogs\nBUDGET RANGE : $200–$5,000+/day\nRISK LEVEL : 🟢 LOW-MODERATE\nSPEED : Fast with strong creative pipeline\nDIFFICULTY : ⭐⭐☆☆☆ (Beginner-Intermediate)\nIDEAL PHASE : Month 2+ with 500+ pixel purchase events"
