        "body": "🔥 METHOD 7: LOOKALIKE AUDIENCE SCALING METHOD\nMETHOD 7: LOOKALIKE AUDIENCE SCALING\n\"Clone Your Best Customers at Massive Scale\"\nPHASE 1: BUILD HIGH-QUALITY SEED AUDIENCES (Day 1-3)\nQuality of LLA = Quality of seed audience\nBuild multiple seed audiences ranked by quality:\nSeed Tier 1 — BEST (Highest Value Customers)\n→ Top 25% customers by order value (upload CSV)\n→ Customers who bought 2+ times\n→ Customers who bought high-ticket bundles\nSeed Tier 2 — STRONG (All Buyers)\n→ All purchase pixel events (last 180 days)\n→ Email list — verified buyers only\nSeed Tier 3 — GOOD (Engaged Non-Buyers)\n→ Initiate Checkout (no purchase) — last 60 days\n→ Add to Cart (no purchase) — last 60 days\n→ 75%+ video viewers — last 60 days\nPHASE 2: LLA SCALING MATRIX (Day 3-5)\nBuild a full matrix of LLAs to test and scale:\nSeed LLA % USA Size Est. CPM\nTop 25% buyers 1% ~2.1M High\nTop 25% buyers 2% ~4.2M Med-High\nAll buyers 1% ~2.1M Med-High\nAll buyers 1–3% ~6.3M Medium\nAll buyers 3–5% ~10.5M Med-Low\nEmail list buyers 1% ~2.1M Med-High\n75% video viewers 1% ~2.1M Medium\n75% video viewers 2–5% ~10.5M Lower\nPHASE 3: LLA CAMPAIGN STRUCTURE (Day 5-10)\nCBO Campaign: \"LLA Scale — [Date]\"\nBudget: $200–$500/day at CBO level\nLoad 4–6 best LLA audiences as separate ad sets\nSame winning creatives in all LLA ad sets\nExclude: All past purchasers from all LLA ad sets\nLet CBO allocate budget between LLAs automatically\nPHASE 4: LLA EXPANSION SCALING (Day 10-21)\nAs buyer data grows → Rebuild LLAs monthly with fresh data\nLLA Refresh Schedule:\nEvery 30 days : Rebuild all LLAs from updated seed\nEvery 60 days : Create new seed from high-LTV buyers\nEvery 90 days : International LLA expansion\nOngoing : Add video viewer LLAs as content grows\nPHASE 5: INTERNATIONAL LLA SCALING (Day 21+)\nUse USA buyer data to create LLAs in:\nUK → 1% LLA from USA purchase seed (high similarity)\nCA → 1% LLA from USA purchase seed\nAU → 1% LLA from USA purchase seed\nThis dramatically lowers international CPMs at launch\nBEST FOR : Scaling beyond interest-based audiences\nBUDGET RANGE : $150–$5,000+/day\nRISK LEVEL : 🟢 LOW-MODERATE\nSPEED : Fast when seed data is high quality\nDIFFICULTY : ⭐⭐⭐⭐☆ (Advanced)\nIDEAL PHASE : Month 2+ with 200+ purchases recorded"
