        "body": "🔥 METHOD 9: RETARGETING SCALE METHOD\nMETHOD 9: RETARGETING SCALE METHOD\n\"Extract Maximum Revenue From Existing Traffic\"\nPHASE 1: RETARGETING SCALE FOUNDATION (Day 1-3)\nRetargeting Scaling Truth:\n• Every $1 spent on prospecting creates warm retarget pool\n• As prospecting scales → retarget pool GROWS automatically\n• Retargeting ROAS is typically 3–8× (vs 2–3× prospecting)\n• Scaling retargeting = extracting value from paid traffic\nScale Ratio Formula:\nProspecting Spend : Retargeting Spend = 80% : 20%\nAt $500/day total:\n→ $400/day prospecting (builds warm audience)\n→ $100/day retargeting (converts warm audience)\nCombined MER target: 3.5-5× blended ROAS\nPHASE 2: SCALED RETARGETING ARCHITECTURE (Day 3-5)\nBuild a layered retargeting system that scales with traffic:\nLAYER 1: HOT RETARGETING (Highest Priority)\nAudience: Initiate Checkout — Last 3 days\nAudience: Add to Cart — Last 3 days\nBudget : $30/day | Bid: Cost Cap at 60% of target CPA\nCreative: Urgency + discount offer + testimonial\nLAYER 2: WARM RETARGETING (Medium Priority)\nAudience: Product Page Visitors — Last 7 days\nAudience: Add to Cart — Last 4-14 days\nBudget : $25/day | Bid: Lowest Cost\nCreative: Social proof + FAQ objection handling\nLAYER 3: COOL RETARGETING (Nurture)\nAudience: Website Visitors (No ATC) — Last 14–30 days\nAudience: 75% Video Viewers — Last 30 days\nBudget : $20/day | Bid: Lowest Cost\nCreative: Educational content + soft sell\nLAYER 4: POST-PURCHASE UPSELL\nAudience: Recent buyers (1–30 days post-purchase)\nBudget : $15/day\nCreative: Bundle upsell / cross-sell / subscription offer\nPHASE 3: RETARGETING WINDOW EXPANSION (Day 5-14)\nAs prospecting spend increases → expand retarget windows:\nProspecting $100/day → Retarget 7-day windows\nProspecting $300/day → Retarget 14-day windows\nProspecting $500/day → Retarget 30-day windows\nProspecting $1000+/day → Retarget 60-day windows\nMore traffic = bigger warm pool = wider retarget windows work\nPHASE 4: DYNAMIC RETARGETING (Advanced Layer)\nEnable: Facebook Dynamic Ads (catalog-based retargeting)\nShows: Exact product someone viewed on your site\nSetup: Connect product catalog → Enable Dynamic format\nAudience: All website visitors last 30 days\nBudget: $20–$40/day — highest ROAS of any ad type\nExpected: 6–12× ROAS on dynamic retargeting at scale\nPHASE 5: EMAIL + SMS RETARGETING INTEGRATION (Ongoing)\nSync email list to Facebook → Run coordinated retargeting\nWhen email send goes out → Suppress that audience from ads\nWhen email sequence ends → Hand off to paid retargeting\nThis \"surround sound\" approach increases conversion by 40%+\nBEST FOR : Maximizing ROAS on existing ad spend\nBUDGET RANGE : $50–$300/day across all retarget layers\nRISK LEVEL : 🟢 LOW (warm audience = low-risk spend)\nSPEED : Immediate — retargeting converts fastest\nDIFFICULTY : ⭐⭐⭐☆☆ (Intermediate)\nIDEAL PHASE : Run from Day 1 — scale proportionally"
