        "body": "🔥 METHOD 1: 1688.COM DEEP MINING METHOD\nMETHOD 1: 1688.COM DEEP MINING\n\"The Wholesale Bible Only Chinese Sellers Know\"\nPHASE 1: UNDERSTANDING 1688.COM (Foundation)\nWhat is 1688.com?\n→ Alibaba's DOMESTIC Chinese wholesale platform\n→ Prices are 60–80% cheaper than Alibaba.com\n→ Real factory-direct pricing (no export markup)\n→ Shows what Chinese factories are ACTUALLY producing NOW\n→ Products here = what AliExpress sells in 3–6 months\n→ Products here = what Amazon FBA sellers sell in 6–12 months\nPrice Comparison Reality:\nPlatform Same Product Price Markup vs 1688\n1688.com $1.20/unit BASELINE (real)\nAliExpress $2.80/unit +133%\nAlibaba.com $3.50/unit +191%\nAmazon FBA $19.99/unit +1,566%\nKnowing 1688 prices = knowing your TRUE margin potential\nPHASE 2: 1688 ACCESS SETUP (Day 1)\nStep 1: Go to 1688.com on Google Chrome browser\nStep 2: Install Chrome extension: \"Google Translate\"\nStep 3: Right-click page → \"Translate to English\"\nStep 4: Create free account (use Google account option)\nStep 5: Install extension: \"1688 Product Research Tool\"\nOR use: \"Taobao/Tmall/1688 Product Sourcing\"\nStep 6: Bookmark these key sections:\n1688.com/wow/z/recommend.htm → New product discovery\n1688.com → 采购直播 → Factory live streams\n1688.com → 爆款 (Baokuan) → \"Explosive\" hot products\n1688.com → 新品 (Xinpin) → New product releases\nPHASE 3: SECRET 1688 SEARCH METHODS (Day 1-3)\nMethod A: SORT BY \"SALES VOLUME\" IN LAST 30 DAYS\n→ Search any category in Chinese\n→ Sort by: 最近30天销售量 (Sales in last 30 days)\n→ Products with 10,000+ units sold in 30 days = WINNER SIGNAL\n→ These are products Chinese consumers are buying RIGHT NOW\nMethod B: FIND \"TRENDING\" BADGE PRODUCTS\n→ Look for 爆款 badge (Baokuan = \"explosive product\")\n→ This badge = platform-verified trending product\n→ Filter by badge → sort by newest listing date\n→ New 爆款 listings = emerging trends not yet on AliExpress\nMethod C: FACTORY LIVE STREAM MINING\n→ Go to 采购直播 (factory live streams section)\n→ Watch factories showing NEW products LIVE\n→ Products being shown live = products factories are\npushing HARD right now = upcoming wave products\n→ Note: products with highest viewer count = highest demand\nMethod D: IMAGE SEARCH (REVERSE PRODUCT RESEARCH)\n→ Take screenshot of product from TikTok/Instagram/Pinterest\n→ Upload image to 1688 image search (camera icon)\n→ Find the FACTORY source of viral products\n→ Compare their factory price vs what Western sellers charge\n→ This reveals the EXACT margin of any viral product\nPHASE 4: 1688 PRODUCT VALIDATION CHECKLIST (Day 3-5)\nFor every potential product, verify:\n✅ Monthly sales > 500 units (proven demand)\n✅ Minimum 3 competing suppliers (not monopoly)\n✅ Supplier rating > 4.5 stars (reliable factory)\n✅ Factory has 2+ years in business on platform\n✅ MOQ (minimum order) fits your budget\n✅ Product photos show real manufacturing capability\n✅ Price per unit allows 5× markup for Western markets\n✅ NOT yet visible on AliExpress top sellers\n✅ NOT yet visible on Amazon Best Sellers\nPHASE 5: CONTACT SUPPLIER ON 1688 (Day 5-7)\nUse this message template (copy-paste into 1688 chat):\n1. 最小起订量是多少？\n2. 可以定制包装和标志吗？\n3. 是否可以寄送样品到美国/英国？\n4. 交货时间是多少天？\nTRANSLATION:\nHello! I am an international buyer interested in your\nproduct. Can you tell me:\n1. What is the minimum order quantity?\n2. Can you customize packaging and logo?\n3. Can you send samples to USA/UK?\n4. What is the production lead time?\nSECRET INTEL : 1688 prices = true COGS baseline\nPRODUCT LEAD : 3–6 months ahead of AliExpress trends\nDIFFICULTY : ⭐⭐⭐☆☆ (needs translation tools)\nBEST FOR : Finding untapped products before competitors\nACCESS : Free — browser + Google Translate"
