        "body": "🔥 METHOD 2: TAOBAO TREND INTELLIGENCE METHOD\nMETHOD 2: TAOBAO TREND INTELLIGENCE\n\"China's Amazon — Where Consumer Trends Are Born\"\nPHASE 1: TAOBAO OVERVIEW (Understanding the Platform)\nWhat is Taobao?\n→ China's #1 consumer marketplace (Alibaba Group)\n→ 900 million active buyers — biggest e-commerce in world\n→ What Chinese consumers BUY TODAY = global trend in 6 months\n→ Shows real consumer demand (not just wholesale production)\n→ Products with high Taobao reviews = proven mass appeal\nThe Intelligence Timeline:\nTaobao trending NOW → AliExpress trending in 2-3 months\nTaobao trending NOW → TikTok viral in USA in 3-4 months\nTaobao trending NOW → Amazon best seller in 6-9 months\nTaobao trending NOW → Saturated in 12-18 months\nPHASE 2: TAOBAO SECRET RESEARCH SECTIONS (Day 1)\nAccess these hidden goldmine sections:\nSECTION 1: Taobao Trending (淘宝热卖)\nURL: taobao.com → click \"热卖\" or \"爆款\"\nShows: Real-time best selling products by category\nFilter: Last 24 hours / 7 days / 30 days\nSECTION 2: Taobao New Arrivals (新品)\nURL: taobao.com → click \"新品首发\"\nShows: Brand new products just hitting Chinese market\nIntel: These products = 6–12 months ahead of West\nSECTION 3: Taobao Live Commerce (淘宝直播)\nURL: taobao.com → click \"直播\"\nShows: Live selling streams — highest converting products\nIntel: Products being live sold = proven impulse buyers\nSECTION 4: 双11 / Seasonal Sale Rankings\nURL: During sales events → click \"热销榜\"\nShows: Top 100 products by actual sales volume\nIntel: Most reliable demand signal available anywhere\nPHASE 3: TAOBAO PRODUCT ANALYSIS METHOD (Day 2-4)\nFor each product you find, analyze these data points:\nDATA POINT 1: Monthly Sales Number\nShown as: \"月销X件\" (monthly sales X units)\nTarget: > 1,000 units/month = strong demand signal\nTarget: > 10,000 units/month = MAJOR trend opportunity\nDATA POINT 2: Review Count + Rating\nShown as: Number of \"评价\" (reviews)\nTarget: > 500 reviews with 4.7+ rating = proven product\nRed Flag: < 50 reviews = too new, unproven\nDATA POINT 3: Number of Competing Sellers\nSearch the product → count results on first 3 pages\n< 20 results = LOW competition (early opportunity)\n20-100 results = MODERATE (still viable with angle)\n> 500 results = SATURATED (avoid unless differentiated)\nDATA POINT 4: Price Point Analysis\nCheck what price range sells best on Taobao\nAdd 5–8× markup = your Western market retail price\nIf Western price is competitive = GO signal\nPHASE 4: TAOBAO → WESTERN MARKET TRANSLATION (Day 4-5)\nAsk these questions for every Taobao product:\nQ1: Does this problem exist in Western countries?\nQ2: Is there cultural context needed to sell this?\nQ3: Does this match a Western consumer trend?\nQ4: Can I find it on AliExpress yet? (check NOW)\nQ5: Is it showing on Amazon.com yet? (check NOW)\nQ6: Is anyone advertising this on TikTok/Meta yet?\nQ7: Is the product legal/compliant in target market?\nProduct scoring: 5+ YES answers = STRONG product candidate\nPHASE 5: TAOBAO IMAGE SEARCH HACK (Day 5)\nThe Reverse Intelligence Method:\nStep 1: Find product going viral on TikTok USA/UK\nStep 2: Screenshot the product clearly\nStep 3: Go to Taobao → click camera icon (image search)\nStep 4: Upload screenshot\nStep 5: See ALL Taobao sellers of this product\nStep 6: Note: how many sellers? (low = opportunity)\nStep 7: Find cheapest factory price (this = your COGS)\nStep 8: Verify margin: Factory price × 6 = selling price?\n→ If YES: source directly from these Taobao factories\n→ Contact via: 1688 (B2B) or Taobao (small batch testing)\nSECRET INTEL : Taobao = consumer validation at scale\nPRODUCT LEAD : 3–9 months ahead of Western markets\nDIFFICULTY : ⭐⭐⭐☆☆ (needs translation)\nBEST FOR : Validating product-market fit before buying\nACCESS : Free — taobao.com + Google Translate"
