        "body": "🔥 METHOD 5: ALIEXPRESS SECRET INTELLIGENCE METHOD\nMETHOD 5: ALIEXPRESS SECRET INTELLIGENCE\n\"The Publicly Available Data Nobody Reads Correctly \"\nPHASE 1: ALIEXPRESS AS INTELLIGENCE TOOL (Not Shopping Site)\nMost sellers use AliExpress to BUY products\nElite sellers use AliExpress to RESEARCH trends\nThe data hidden on AliExpress reveals:\n→ Exact global demand (orders from 220+ countries)\n→ Which products are rising vs declining\n→ True COGS before you commit to any product\n→ How many Western competitors already know about this\nPHASE 2: THE 7 SECRET ALIEXPRESS DATA POINTS (Day 1-2)\nSECRET 1: \"Orders\" Number (Most Important Signal)\nEvery AliExpress listing shows total orders\n500–2,000 orders = Early stage (good time to enter)\n2,000–10,000 orders = Growth stage (still opportunity)\n10,000–50,000 orders = Peak (enter with differentiation)\n50,000+ orders = Late (very competitive — avoid)\nSECRET 2: \"Listing Date\" vs \"Order Volume\"\nFind listing date → calculate orders per month\nFormula: Total orders ÷ months listed = monthly velocity\nRising velocity (recent months faster) = ACCELERATING\nThis tells you if trend is starting or ending\nSECRET 3: \"5-Star Review\" Language Mining\nRead ALL 5-star reviews — what words do buyers use?\nThese exact words = your ad copy and landing page text\n\"I was surprised how well this works for [problem]\"\n→ Your headline: \"Customers Are SURPRISED How Well...\"\nSECRET 4: \"1-Star Review\" Problem Mining\nEvery 1-star complaint = product improvement opportunity\n\"Packaging arrived damaged\" → Improve packaging\n\"Took 45 days to arrive\" → Use faster shipping supplier\n\"Instructions unclear\" → Add better instruction manual\nFixing these = instant competitive advantage\nSECRET 5: \"Similar Items\" Section\nScroll down on any product → \"Similar Items\" section\nShows related products ranked by AliExpress algorithm\nProducts appearing here = algorithm-validated demand\nNew products in \"similar\" section = EMERGING products\nSECRET 6: \"Wish List\" Count\nThe \"heart\" icon count shows how many people saved it\nHigh wish list + low orders = pricing barrier (too high)\nHigh wish list + high orders = PERFECT product profile\nLow wish list + high orders = repeat/utility purchase\nSECRET 7: \"Store Feedback\" Score Trend\nClick supplier name → see their store history\nRapidly growing store with 95%+ feedback = hot supplier\nNew products from hot suppliers = their NEXT winning SKU\nPHASE 3: ALIEXPRESS DROPSHIPPING CENTER (Hidden Tool)\nURL: aliexpress.com/gcp/300000512 (Dropshipping Center)\nThis section SPECIFICALLY built for resellers shows:\n→ Top products by ACTUAL SELLER ORDER VOLUME (not consumer)\n→ Products with highest reseller repeat order rates\n→ Items with fastest processing + shipping times\n→ Supplier reliability score for dropshipping\n→ \"Hot Products\" ranking updated every 24 hours\nHow to use Dropshipping Center for research:\nStep 1: Go to Dropshipping Center URL above\nStep 2: Click \"Find Products to Sell\"\nStep 3: Sort by \"Orders\" — highest to lowest\nStep 4: Filter by your target category\nStep 5: Look at products with HIGH orders + LOW reviews\n→ High orders + low reviews = NEW trending product\n→ This is the BEST early-mover signal on AliExpress\nPHASE 4: ALIEXPRESS NEW ARRIVALS INTELLIGENCE (Day 3-4)\nMost powerful filter combination on AliExpress:\nCategory → Sort: Orders → Filter: Listed < 6 months ago\nThis shows: Recently listed products ALREADY getting orders\nWhy powerful: Product is new BUT already converting globally\n= True early-mover signal with proven demand validation\nPHASE 5: ALIEXPRESS PRICE DROP TRACKING (Day 4-5)\nWhen factories suddenly drop prices = they have excess stock\nExcess stock = they overproduced = product was trending hard\nThis = the EXACT window to buy inventory cheaply\nTool: Use \"AliPrice\" Chrome extension\n→ Tracks price history of any AliExpress product\n→ Sudden 30-50% price drop = bulk sourcing opportunity\n→ Buy at price drop → sell at pre-drop Western price\nSECRET INTEL : AliExpress = global demand validation hub\nPRODUCT LEAD : 1–3 months (later than 1688 but validated)\nDIFFICULTY : ⭐⭐☆☆☆ (Beginner-friendly)\nBEST FOR : Validating demand before sourcing\nACCESS : Free — aliexpress.com"
