        "body": "🔥 METHOD 6: WECHAT & XIAOHONGSHU (RED) TREND MINING\nMETHOD 6: XIAOHONGSHU (RED) TREND MINING\n\"China's Pinterest + Instagram = Trend Goldmine\"\nPHASE 1: WHAT IS XIAOHONGSHU? (Foundation)\nXiaohongshu (小红书) = \"Little Red Book\" / called \"RED\"\n→ China's version of Instagram + Pinterest + Amazon Reviews\n→ 300 million users — 70% female, ages 18–35\n→ Highest product discovery platform in China\n→ Products going viral on RED = going viral on Instagram\nin Western markets within 3–6 months\n→ Fashion, beauty, home, lifestyle = strongest categories\n→ User-generated reviews drive purchasing decisions\nPHASE 2: ACCESSING XIAOHONGSHU (Day 1)\nAccess Options:\nOption A: Web browser (Easiest)\n→ Go to: xiaohongshu.com on Chrome\n→ Enable Google Translate extension\n→ No account needed to browse public content\nOption B: Mobile App (Best Experience)\n→ Download: \"小红书\" or \"Xiaohongshu\" or \"RED\" app\n→ Available on App Store with international account\n→ Register with email (international registration OK)\nOption C: Creator Intelligence Dashboard\n→ creator.xiaohongshu.com (analytics platform)\n→ Shows trending hashtags + content categories\nPHASE 3: RED PRODUCT INTELLIGENCE METHODS (Day 2-4)\nINTELLIGENCE METHOD A: TRENDING HASHTAG PRODUCT MINING\n→ Search: #好物推荐 (good product recommendations)\n→ Search: #种草 (product recommendation/endorsement)\n→ Search: #开箱 (unboxing — highest purchase intent)\n→ Filter: Last 7 days + Most liked\n→ Products featured in viral posts = immediate opportunity\nINTELLIGENCE METHOD B: \"爆款\" PRODUCT POSTS\n→ Search: 爆款 + your category keyword\n→ Example: 爆款厨房 = trending kitchen products\n→ Example: 爆款宠物 = trending pet products\n→ Look for posts with 50K+ likes in last 30 days\n→ These products = almost guaranteed Western trend incoming\nINTELLIGENCE METHOD C: SKINCARE + BEAUTY TOOL MINING\n→ RED is the #1 beauty product discovery platform in China\n→ Search: 美容仪 (beauty device) + filter: Most liked\n→ Search: 护肤神器 (skincare miracle tool)\n→ Beauty tools on RED = Pinterest/Instagram trend in 4-6 mo\n→ This niche has the highest East→West transfer rate\nPHASE 4: RED CONTENT MINING FOR AD CREATIVE INTEL (Day 4-5)\nUse RED posts as creative intelligence:\nWhat to steal from viral RED posts:\n→ The hook style (how they open the video/photo)\n→ The product demonstration angle\n→ The before/after format\n→ The lifestyle setting (kitchen, bedroom, outdoor)\n→ The emotional angle (convenience, transformation)\n→ The caption structure (problem → solution → result)\nAdapt these creative frameworks for Western audiences\nPHASE 5: RED → WESTERN PLATFORM LAUNCH SEQUENCE (Day 5-7)\nProduct found on RED → Source on 1688 → Order samples\nCreative format found on RED → Recreate for Pinterest/TikTok\nRED aesthetic (clean, pastel, minimal) → Apply to store design\nRED UGC style → Brief Western UGC creators same way\nSECRET INTEL : RED = Instagram/Pinterest trend oracle\nPRODUCT LEAD : 3–6 months ahead of Western Instagram trends\nDIFFICULTY : ⭐⭐⭐☆☆ (needs translation + setup)\nBEST FOR : Beauty, lifestyle, home, fashion products\nACCESS : Free — xiaohongshu.com"
