        "body": "🔥 METHOD 8: CHINESE PRODUCT SPY TOOLS METHOD\nMETHOD 8: CHINESE PRODUCT SPY TOOLS\n\"Automated Intelligence Gathering at Scale\"\nPHASE 1: THE SPY TOOL ECOSYSTEM (Overview)\nThese tools scrape Chinese platforms and translate\nproduct data into actionable English-language reports\nThey save 80% of research time vs manual methods\nPHASE 2: ESSENTIAL SPY TOOL STACK (Day 1)\nTOOL 1: DROPSHIPMAN\nURL: dropshipman.com\nCost: Free + $19–$39/month premium\nFeatures:\n→ Connects 1688 + AliExpress + Taobao in one dashboard\n→ Auto-translates product listings\n→ Shows trending products across ALL Chinese platforms\n→ One-click import to Shopify\n→ Price comparison across multiple Chinese suppliers\nTOOL 2: PPSPY (Product Research Tool)\nURL: ppspy.com\nCost: $29/month\nFeatures:\n→ Tracks AliExpress bestsellers in real-time\n→ Shows order velocity (orders per day trending)\n→ Competitor Shopify store product analysis\n→ Identifies products going from 0 to 1000+ orders fast\nTOOL 3: ECOMHUNT\nURL: ecomhunt.com\nCost: Free + $29/month pro\nFeatures:\n→ Curated winning products from AliExpress daily\n→ Shows Facebook ad performance data per product\n→ AliExpress order data + saturation score\n→ Includes targeting suggestions per product\nTOOL 4: NICHE SCRAPER\nURL: nichescraper.com\nCost: $49/month\nFeatures:\n→ Auto-scrapes AliExpress for order velocity spikes\n→ Identifies products gaining orders in last 7–30 days\n→ Shopify spy — finds products from competitor stores\n→ Video ad finder — shows winning Facebook video ads\nTOOL 5: CJDROPSHIPPING PRODUCT FINDER\nURL: cjdropshipping.com\nCost: FREE (their business model is fulfillment)\nFeatures:\n→ Direct 1688 sourcing with English interface\n→ \"Hot Products\" section updated daily\n→ USA/EU warehouse stock available (fast shipping)\n→ Lower MOQ than 1688 direct (good for testing)\nTOOL 6: THIEVE.CO (AliExpress Curation)\nURL: thieve.co\nCost: Free + $15/month pro\nFeatures:\n→ Human-curated AliExpress products (design-focused)\n→ Highest aesthetic quality products selected\n→ Best for: Design-forward, premium product categories\n→ FREE version shows trending products weekly\nPHASE 3: SPY TOOL RESEARCH WORKFLOW (Day 2-3)\nDaily Research Workflow (45 minutes/day):\n9:00 AM : Check Ecomhunt \"New Today\" products (10 min)\n9:10 AM : Filter Niche Scraper for 7-day velocity\nspikes in target categories (10 min)\n9:20 AM : Check PPSPY for order acceleration alerts\n(products going from 500 to 2000+ orders)\n9:30 AM : Cross-reference finds on 1688 for true COGS\n9:40 AM : Check Amazon/TikTok saturation for shortlist\n9:50 AM : Add validated products to tracking list\nPHASE 4: CROSS-PLATFORM VALIDATION USING SPY TOOLS (Day 3-5)\nFor every product flagged by spy tools:\nStep 1: Confirm on AliExpress (order velocity rising?)\nStep 2: Find on 1688 (what is true factory price?)\nStep 3: Check Douyin (is it viral in China right now?)\nStep 4: Check TikTok USA (any videos yet?)\nStep 5: Check Amazon (BSR + review count)\nStep 6: Check Facebook Ad Library (any ads running?)\nStep 7: Score product → GO or NO-GO decision\nPHASE 5: BUILDING YOUR OWN SPY SYSTEM (Advanced)\nFor sellers spending $500+/month on research:\n→ Use Apify (apify.com) to create custom AliExpress scrapers\n→ Set up Google Alerts for Chinese e-commerce trend reports\n→ Hire a Chinese virtual assistant on Upwork ($5–$15/hour)\nto monitor 1688, Taobao, RED, Douyin daily\n→ Build your own trend dashboard using Notion/Airtable\nSECRET INTEL : Automated monitoring at scale\nPRODUCT LEAD : 1–4 months (tool-dependent)\nDIFFICULTY : ⭐⭐☆☆☆ (Beginner-friendly interfaces)\nBEST FOR : High-volume product research + dropshipping\nCOST : $0–$150/month depending on tools"
