        "meta": {},
        "body": "🔥 MEGA METHOD 1: PRICE OPTIMIZATION & PSYCHOLOGY\nMEGA METHOD 1: PRICE PSYCHOLOGY & OPTIMIZATION\n\"Small Price Changes = Massive Revenue Impact\"\nMETHOD 001: PRICE ANCHORING (Highest Impact)\nWhat: Show fake \"original price\" before discount\nExample: Show \"$49.99\" crossed out, sell for \"$19.99\"\nPsychology: Brain calculates 60% savings = perceived value\nResult: +35-47% increase in conversion rate\nImplementation:\n→ Add to product description: \"Was: $49.99 | Now: $19.99\"\n→ Use red strikethrough on \"Was\" price\n→ Add \"SAVE $30\" badge prominently\nReal Example:\nWITHOUT anchoring: $19.99 → 2% conversion (100 sales/5K views)\nWITH anchoring: $19.99 → 3.4% conversion (170 sales/5K views)\nRevenue increase: +70 sales × $19.99 = +$1,399/month\nCost to implement: $0 (software change only)\nROI: Infinite\nMETHOD 002: THE CHARM PRICING TACTIC (99 Endings)\nWhat: Price products at .99 instead of round numbers\nExample: $24.99 instead of $25.00\nPsychology: Brain reads left-first digit (24 = cheaper)\nResult: +8-15% higher conversion rate\nWhy it works: $24.99 feels like $20 range, not $25 range\nImplementation:\n→ Change ALL prices to end in .99 or .95\n→ Exception: Premium/luxury products (use .00 or .97)\nTested Price Points (by conversion rate):\n$9.99 → 8.2% conversion (best for low-ticket)\n$19.99 → 6.8% conversion\n$29.99 → 5.4% conversion\n$39.99 → 4.1% conversion\n$49.99 → 3.2% conversion (sweet spot for mid-tier)\n$99.99 → 1.8% conversion\n$199.99 → 0.8% conversion\nMETHOD 003: TIERED PRICING STRATEGY (Bundle Upsell)\nCreate 3 price tiers to capture different customer segments:\nTIER 1 — BASIC (Entry Price)\n→ 1 sewing pattern\n→ Price: $9.99\n→ Conversion: 8-10%\nPurpose: Get customer in door\nTIER 2 — POPULAR (Middle Price) ← MOST PROFITABLE\n→ 5 sewing patterns (bundle)\n→ Price: $34.99 (should be $49.95 individually = save $15)\n→ Conversion: 5-6%\n→ Margin: 60-65% (best margins usually here)\nPurpose: Sweet spot for AOV + margin\nTIER 3 — PREMIUM (Luxury Price)\n→ 20 sewing patterns + lifetime updates + video tutorials\n→ Price: $99.99 (individual value = $200)\n→ Conversion: 2-3%\nPurpose: Capture high-intent, premium customers\nRevenue per 1,000 visitors (assuming 5% avg conversion):\nSingle price $29.99 → 50 sales × $29.99 = $1,499.50\n3-tier structure:\n→ 80 sales @ $9.99 = $799.20 (80% of traffic to basic)\n→ 15 sales @ $34.99 = $524.85 (15% upgrade from basic)\n→ 3 sales @ $99.99 = $299.97 (3% premium buyers)\n→ Total: 98 sales × avg $18.21 = $1,784.58\n→ Revenue increase: +$285.08 (+19% higher)\nIMPLEMENTATION: Use Shopify apps like:\n• Shopify built-in \"Variants\" → Create price tiers\n• Bold Product Options → Advanced tiering\n• PageFly → Custom landing pages per tier\nMETHOD 004: DYNAMIC PRICING (Time-Based Increases)\nWhat: Change price based on time/inventory/demand\nStrategy: Raise price as demand increases (scarcity works)\nEXAMPLE — WEEKLY PRICING SCHEDULE:\nMonday–Wednesday: $19.99 (slow traffic days, discount)\nThursday–Friday: $24.99 (weekend prep, higher traffic)\nSaturday–Sunday: $29.99 (peak traffic, highest price)\nResult: +15-22% revenue without losing conversion\nEXAMPLE — INVENTORY-BASED PRICING:\n• 100+ units left: $19.99 (low scarcity signal)\n• 50–100 units: $24.99 (moderate scarcity)\n• 10–50 units: $29.99 (high scarcity — \"only 23 left!\")\n• <10 units: $34.99 (extreme scarcity — \"last 3!\")\nResult: Last 10 units sell at 75% higher price\nTools for implementation:\n• Shopify Flow + Price Change automation\n• Bold Pricing Rules app\n• Manual: Check dashboard every 3 days, adjust prices\nMETHOD 005: PSYCHOLOGICAL PRICE ANCHORING (Multiple Sizes)\nDisplay most expensive option FIRST to anchor perception:\nBAD LAYOUT (lowest to highest):\n1 pattern — $9.99\n5 patterns — $34.99\n20 patterns — $99.99\nResult: Customers default to lowest price ($9.99)\nGOOD LAYOUT (highest to lowest):\n20 patterns ($99.99) ← Show FIRST — anchors price perception\n5 patterns ($34.99) ← Middle feels like great value now\n1 pattern ($9.99) ← \"Cheapest option\" feels like theft\nResult: More customers choose $34.99 (best margin tier)\nConversion shift: -3% on $9.99, +8% on $34.99, +2% on $99.99\nRevenue increase: +18-25%"
